---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import family from '../../assets/autism-first-conversation-20260930.png';
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import {ASK,SITE,dimensions,guides} from '../../lib/ask/content';
import AskContact from './AskContact.astro';
import {curatedPriorityAnswer,curatedPrioritySlugs} from '../../lib/ask/priority-editorial';
const {lang='en'}=Astro.props;const local=lang==='te'?ASK+'/te':ASK;
---
<section class="ask-wrap ask-hero">
 <div><p class="ask-eyebrow">ASK PINNACLE · FOR FAMILIES & PROFESSIONALS</p><h1>{lang==='te'?'మీ బిడ్డ గురించి మీ ప్రశ్నలు. మొదలుపెట్టడానికి క్లారిటీ.':'Your questions matter. Start with clarity.'}</h1><p class="ask-lead">{lang==='te'?'మాటలు, ఆటలు, రోజువారీ పనులు, నేర్చుకోవడం గురించి తెలుసుకోండి. మీ బిడ్డకు సరిపోయే తర్వాతి అడుగు గురించి మాతో మాట్లాడండి.':'Speech, play, learning, everyday routines. Find explanations that help you understand your child and have a more informed conversation about the next step.'}</p><a class="ask-button" href="#explore">Explore the answers <Icon name="arrow"/></a><p class="ask-small">Pinnacle Blooms Network · General information for a conversation with your care team.</p></div>
 <figure><Image src={family} width={680} format="webp" quality={82} alt="Illustrative Pinnacle family conversation with a therapist about their child’s everyday goals" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Understanding your child. Working toward a self-sufficient, mainstream-included life.</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<section class="ask-wrap ask-section" id="explore"><p class="ask-eyebrow">START WHERE YOU ARE</p><h2>What would you like to understand?</h2><p><a href={ASK+'/topic-index'}>Browse every published topic A–Z →</a></p><div class="ask-topic-grid">{dimensions.map(d=><a class="ask-topic-card" href={local+'/'+d.slug}><Icon name={d.icon}/><h3>{d.title}</h3><p>{d.description}</p><span class="ask-read">Explore questions →</span></a>)}</div></section>
{lang==='en'&&<section class="ask-wrap ask-section"><p class="ask-eyebrow">UNDERSTAND THE WORDS. PLAN THE SUPPORT.</p><h2>Popular questions, explained with sources.</h2><div class="ask-topic-grid">{curatedPrioritySlugs.map(slug=>{const a=curatedPriorityAnswer(slug)!;return <a class="ask-topic-card" href={a.canonical}><Icon name="book"/><h3>{a.title}</h3><p>{a.meta_description}</p><span class="ask-read">Read the explanation →</span></a>})}</div><p>School and administrative support: <a href={ASK+'/what-is-an-iep-individualised-education-plan'}>IEP planning</a> · <a href={ASK+'/what-is-a-shadow-teacher-and-does-my-child-need-one'}>Shadow teachers</a> · <a href={ASK+'/how-do-i-get-a-disability-certificate-for-my-child-in-india'}>Disability certificate and UDID</a>.</p></section>}
<section class="ask-band"><div class="ask-wrap ask-section"><p class="ask-eyebrow">FROM UNDERSTANDING TO EVERYDAY LIFE</p><h2>A question can open the next step.</h2><div class="ask-topic-grid">{Object.entries(guides).slice(0,5).map(([slug,g]:any)=><a class="ask-topic-card" href={local+'/'+slug}><Icon name="compass"/><h3>{g.title}</h3><p>{g.intro}</p><span class="ask-read">Find out more →</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="ask-wrap ask-section ask-explain"><div><Icon name="loop"/><h2>Your child’s life is the purpose.</h2><p>Knowledge becomes useful when it helps shape the next step. PinnacleAI® connects ability measurement, a child-specific plan, integrated therapies, everyday practice and review around that purpose.</p><a href={SITE+'/pinnacleai'}>Explore PinnacleAI® →</a></div><div><Icon name="book"/><h2>Explore the source behind a statement.</h2><p>Answer pages carry their available references. For Pinnacle’s licences, research, definitions and dated institutional measures, use our public evidence hub.</p><a href={SITE+'/verify/'}>Explore Pinnacle Verify →</a><p><a href={ASK+'/dataset'}>How to read, share and cite Ask →</a></p></div></section><AskContact/>
